    "authoredBasis": "Authored numerical graph y=10^x on the mantissa window 0<=x<=1, 1<=y<=10. The full related task contains five positive inputs spanning different decades; integer shifts 10^(k+t)=10^k 10^t allow this honest normalized graph to support every lookup and inverse lookup. Fine grid x step .02, y step .2; axis labels .0,.2,...,1.0 and 1,2,4,6,8,10. No requested result, input logarithm, or output marker is annotated. No original source image exists.",
